        "eligibilityCriteria": {
          "eligibilityDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "For Individual Farmers:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The applicant must be a farmer."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": " The applicant must belong to the Gujarat state."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The water tank must be constructed on the applicant’s own farmland."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The farmer must have adopted the "
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Micro Irrigation System (MIS)"
                        }
                      ],
                      "link": "https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2003188",
                      "type": "link"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The farmer must cover at least one hectare of land per 75 cubic meters of water tank under MIS."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "For Group of Farmers:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The group must consist of two or more farmers."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The group must belong to the Gujarat state."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The group must select one farmer as the leader, who will submit the application on behalf of the group."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The water tank must be constructed on the land of one of the farmers in the group."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Each member of the group must have adopted the "
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Micro Irrigation System (MIS)"
                        }
                      ],
                      "link": "https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2003188",
                      "type": "link"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The group must cover at least one hectare of land per 75 cubic meters of water tank under MIS."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Note:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "No separate registration is required for the group; they only need to submit a mutual consent certificate."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The benefit is available only once in a lifetime (For both Individual and Group of Farmers)."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            }
          ],
          "eligibilityDescription_md": "> **For Individual Farmers:**\n\n\n- The applicant must be a farmer.\n-  The applicant must belong to the Gujarat state.\n- The water tank must be constructed on the applicant’s own farmland.\n- The farmer must have adopted the [Micro Irrigation System (MIS)](https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2003188).- The farmer must cover at least one hectare of land per 75 cubic meters of water tank under MIS.\n\n> **For Group of Farmers:**\n\n\n- The group must consist of two or more farmers.\n- The group must belong to the Gujarat state.\n- The group must select one farmer as the leader, who will submit the application on behalf of the group.\n- The water tank must be constructed on the land of one of the farmers in the group.\n- Each member of the group must have adopted the [Micro Irrigation System (MIS)](https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2003188).- The group must cover at least one hectare of land per 75 cubic meters of water tank under MIS.\n\n> **Note:**\n\n\n- No separate registration is required for the group; they only need to submit a mutual consent certificate.\n- The benefit is available only once in a lifetime (For both Individual and Group of Farmers).\n\n"
        },
